  "sourceTitle": "Blackberry Icing",
  "sourceText": "Blackberry Icing\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, February 11, 2010 - 5:46am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups Powdered sugar, sifted\n1 dsh Salt\ncup Blackberries, fresh, crushed\n2 teaspoons Lemon juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Add sugar and salt to crushed fruit, mixing well. Then add lemon juice until of consistency to spread thinly on cake. 2 Makes enough icing to covertop and sides of angel food cake.",
